 autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270680/extras/a9bdf604ef8d7aeaa0d8941def4a2789.poster.avif?t=1781964882\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270680/extras/a9bdf604ef8d7aeaa0d8941def4a2789.webm?t=1781964882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270680/extras/a9bdf604ef8d7aeaa0d8941def4a2789.mp4?t=1781964882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okay, these mechanics aren't particularly unique, I guess. You might have seen some of them in other games...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO AI-generated art or text</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every image and word in this game is handmade. Yes, they are not perfect. But you can be sure that hours of human effort have gone into them!</p>", "short_description": "An elven sorceress decides to visit her old friend, but gets caught up in a series of exciting (and slightly lewd) adventures, where she finds new friends, rare spells... and loses her swimsuit.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270680/header.jpg?t=1781964882", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270680/6684830e4286d5e6e0346c8359daaf965fad2c8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781964882", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270680/6684830e4286d5e6e0346c8359daaf965fad2c8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781964882", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Vista or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 125 MB available